        "h_title": "Popular Restaurants in Khao Sok and Cheow Lan Lake:\nSavor Thai Cuisine and Fresh Seafood Amidst Nature",
        "main_title": "Top Restaurants in Khao Sok",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "For tourists visiting Khao Sok and Cheow Lan Lake, tasting the local cuisine is an experience not to be missed. Spicy Thai food made from fresh ingredients, as well as fresh seafood sourced from local waters, are very popular. Many restaurants in the area offer a wide variety of local and Thai dishes in a relaxing atmosphere, surrounded by the beautiful nature of forests and lakes. Dining here will add a special touch to your journey.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
